    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    triggerEvent:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speakerID: a
    text: What's going on in the news has only made me stay in more too.
    thoughts: []
    voiceLine: {fileID: 0}
    triggerEvent:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speakerID: a
    text: So I just...am always by myself.
